[Q] quaternary quadratic forms over F_p with the class counts of a1 a2 + b1 b2 (p = 2, 3)
  p = 2: 1024 forms; same number of zeros as the seam: 280; same class counts: 280, of which with non-degenerate polar form: 280
  p = 3: 59049 forms; same number of zeros as the seam: 21060; same class counts: 21060, of which with non-degenerate polar form: 21060
  (so over F_2 and F_3 the seam counts force a non-degenerate polar form, i.e. an even unimodular form at p)
